OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA largely
OL,6,Ffine evening with any showery rain in
OL,7,Fthe south soon clearing. Thereafter, a
OL,8,Fdry night with clear periods. Winds
OL,9,Feasing down and temperatures falling
OL,10,Faway, especially in the countryside
OL,11,Fwhere it may turn rather cool locally.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FA fine day on Sunday with
OL,14,Flighter winds and plenty of sunny
OL,15,Fspells. The sunshine may turn hazy at
OL,16,Ftimes, but staying bright and feeling
OL,17,Fwarm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
