OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry
OL,6,Fon Monday and Tuesday with sunny
OL,7,Fspells. Chilly nights at first with
OL,8,Fpatchy fog, though feeling warm in the
OL,9,Fafternoons with temperatures above
OL,10,Faverage. Chance of rain on Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
